	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What's this?”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Akari suddenly lets out a confused murmur.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wait... what's going on?”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's the matter?”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hmm...”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Akari frowns, as though trying to find the right words.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"What's she thinking about?",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, can you try touching my body?”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Er, it's still the middle of the day.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I mean, not that I mind.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's not what I freaking meant!”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Akari blushes furiously, banging her fist on the armrest of her chair.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"After rolling her eyes at me for good measure, she clears her throat before continuing.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I want you to touch my body and see if you can reach the Founding Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto?”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto's soul is still housed inside Akari's body.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"She apparently responds occasionally when Akari tries to talk to her, but her soul otherwise spends most of its time slumbering.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I haven't been able to get a single response out of her since yesterday.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm honestly a little worried, so do you mind trying to reach her yourself?”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All right, I'll give it a shot.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"Akari takes a deep breath and closes her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"I place my hand on her shoulder and try calling out to Himi-no-Mikoto.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto, can you hear me?”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Rise and shine, Himi-no-Mikoto. The sun is up already.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"Nope, nothing.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"Just as I'm about to give up...",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What the─?!”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"A surge of mysterious magicks rises up from deep inside\nAkari's body.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"The invisible force coils itself around my arm, refusing to let me go.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"Though I can't see anything, it feels just like a snake slithering across my skin.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"I try to pull my arm away from Akari, but it's as though my hand has been fused to her shoulder.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari!”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"Despite my cry, Akari's closed eyelids don't flicker in the slightest.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"Is she unable to hear me?",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"The mysterious power continues crawling up my arm until it eventually engulfs my entire body.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's... going on...?”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"With that as my last thought, my consciousness slowly fades into nothingness.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hmm?”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"When I come to, I find myself standing alone in the audience chamber.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"I look around, but don't spot a single other soul.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"Just what in the world is going on here?",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hey! Get back here!”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori?”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If you call yourself an Inou, face me head-to-head!”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Hold your horses! And put your blade away! What do you think you're doing, pointing that thing at your ancestor?!”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Tooru?!”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"I don't believe my ears for a second.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"But still, there's no doubt that was Tooru's voice just now.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Ohh, Mitsurugi! You couldn't have come a second too soon!”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Tooru, is it really you?!”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"My eyes well up with warmth at the sight of my oldest friend.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"It really is him in the flesh, even though he's supposed to be─",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Teyaaaah!”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Gaaaaaahh!”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"Tooru lets out a bloodcurdling scream as Hotori swings for his head.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"Dodging the slash by a hair's breadth, he immediately rushes to cower behind my back.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“S-Save me, Mitsurugi!”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hold it! What's going on here?!”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Hahaha! How do you like that, Hotori?! I don't care if\nyou're a descendant of House Inou or what, but good luck trying to take on Mitsurugi!”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"Tooru jeers, pointing a defiant finger at Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Using another as a shield? You coward!”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin. Stand aside.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"Brandishing her naked blade, Hotori stomps closer one menacing step at a time.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I refuse to believe the progenitor of House Inou could be such a spineless weakling.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“As a fellow Inou and the Executor of the warriors' will, I shall set you straight!”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"Hotori levels her blade at me, practically radiating murderous intent.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi, what's she mean by 'the Executor'?”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's the title taken by our leader.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But forget that. There's more important─”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hah!”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"In the blink of an eye, Hotori circles around me to slash at\nTooru's exposed back.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Whaagh!”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Kgh! Good at running away, aren't you?!”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Get back here! If you call yourself an Inou, then fight me, dammit!”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"Tooru runs for dear life, Hotori hot on his heels.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"I couldn't even get a word in edgewise.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“How very like Hotori-sama to show no quarter, even to her own ancestor.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone!? You were here this whole time?”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"At some point, Kotone had slid up right next to me.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"She nods simply, continuing to watch the spectacle unfolding with a manjuu in hand.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Om nom... She really ought to show more reverence to her ancestors.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Would you not agree, Chihaya-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Indeed, I most certainly do!”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"Chihaya suddenly pokes her head out from behind\nKotone's back.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Hmm?”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Chihaya?!”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Ahh! Wh-Whatever is the matter?!”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Can you blame me for being shocked?!”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“First Tooru and now you... What are you doing here?!”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"Too stunned even for words, I grab Chihaya by the shoulder and shake her up and down.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Awawawawawa...!”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“P-Please unhand me, Mitsurugi-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“S-Sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ooh, what a rare sight to see Soujin-sama so flustered.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"Kotone comments detachedly as she watches on from the sidelines.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Does she not find this whole situation hard to believe?",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah, Chihaya-sama, have some manjuu.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Why, thank you!”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"Kotone generously splits her manjuu with Chihaya like\nthey're the best of friends.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"Given their blood relation, it goes without saying that their mannerisms are identical as they eagerly dig in.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"Their blissful expressions certainly are a charming sight, but now's not the time.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone, what in the world is going on here?”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Om nom... Ahhh, Samuraya's manjuu really are perfection in a bun, om nom nom...”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"She isn't hearing a word I'm saying...",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Chihaya, can you maybe─”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Om nom nom... mmmhmm! Om nom...”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"Nope, this one has nothing but manjuu on the brain as well.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"The pair swallow their bites at the exact same time, their expressions melting in contented unison.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone & Chihaya"},
			{
"“Ahhhh... That was delicious...” “Ahhhh... That was delicious...”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"It's no use. The combination of these two together is throwing me off my stride.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"Maybe I'll have better luck with those two─",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Haah, haahh... I haven't got another step in me...”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Shiranui!”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"A blaze of flames flares up from Hotori's blade.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Hot hot hot hot hot!”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi! Save me!”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Have at you!”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“S-Stoooop!”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Get back heeere!”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Tooru scrabbles to his feet and flees towards the palace gates.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"Hotori wastes no time in chasing after him.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Mmh, mmh... Care for a manjuu, Soujin-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Om nom... Shall I prepare some tea?”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"Meanwhile, these two still have their heads full of manjuu.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"Looks like neither House Inou nor House Shiinoha is going to be of any use.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"Seriously, what in the world is going on here?",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"You can't seriously be telling me the Tenkyo of the past and present have merged together...",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, Soujin-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It is almost time for your audience.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Shall we, Mitsurugi-sama? Her Majesty is awaiting your presence.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“An audience? With the Empress?”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"With Akari? Or could it be Himi-no-Mikoto?",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"At this point, it could really be either of them.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"Each grabbing one of my arms, Kotone and Chihaya drag me towards the palace.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Come, Soujin-sama! ≪Hurry, hurry!≫”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Kotone? Whatever does that mean?”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It means 'kindly get your rear in gear!'”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“I see! What a marvelous expression!”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi-sama, ≪hurry, hurry!≫!”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"The pair of priestesses continue merrily pulling me by the arms.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"Having nowhere else to be anyway, I allow myself to be dragged along.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"They lead me all through the palace, finally depositing me in front of the Empress's private chambers.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“We shall be taking our leave then.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"Kotone and Chihaya offer me a pair of identical bows before slipping out of sight at the end of the corridor.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"At any rate, either Akari or Himi-no-Mikoto should be behind this door.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"Hopefully they'll be able to get me out of this mess.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"Just as I'm thinking this, the door slides open on its own.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You sure took your sweet time, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I trust that your dalliance was worth squandering the time of two Empresses, Mitsurugi?”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course. Both.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"Both Akari and Himi-no-Mikoto step out of the room at the same time.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"Akari wastes no time in sidling up to me.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"As I unthinkingly take her into my arms, a displeased scowl crosses over Himi-no-Mikoto's face.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Akari, 'tis most underhanded to steal a march like that.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi, show your true Empress some affection.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Whoa, what gives...?”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto shows no shame in squeezing between me and Akari.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"And so, I find myself with two overfond Empresses nestled in my embrace.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey, this is supposed to be my special place.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Ahh, it has been far too long since we've come together like this, has it not, Mitsurugi?”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"They both peer up at me at the same time.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"Akari's cheeks are puffed out in clear displeasure, while Himi-no-Mikoto flashes me a contented smile.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"Though their beautiful features are a spitting image of the other, their dispositions and mannerisms are entirely different.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hang on. This isn't the time to be─”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Oh, what's the harm?”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Your Empress wills it, so entertain her a while longer,\nwon't you?”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto fixes me with a searching gaze, and I find myself unable to look away.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"The striking sensation of her peering into the depths of my soul renders my body wholly immobile.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"Unbidden, the recollections of my time spent as Mitsurugi surge vividly to the fore of my consciousness.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"At once, the distinction between the egos, the personalities, the lived experiences of Mitsurugi and Tokita Soujin begins to blur─",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"And as his and my identities meld together, the ardent feelings in my heart are transfigured into an irrepressible love for both Akari and Himi-no-Mikoto.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"I am at once both Tokita Soujin and Mitsurugi.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"Thus, there could be no greater joy than holding both of the women I love most.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Come now, Akari, don't push. You'll separate me from Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Why you... show some respect for your forebearer!”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“This is ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"my",
{"/font"},
" special place.”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You've already had your time in the sun, Granny.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Who are you calling your granny?!”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Augh!”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto unceremoniously chops Akari on the forehead.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't fight now.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"I hug both of them back equally to defuse the tension, and though neither looks fully satisfied, they at least stop their bickering.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Haah... I summoned Mitsurugi here for more important matters than this.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Come, Akari!”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah, hold it!”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto grabs Akari by the arm and tears her away from me.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"She proceeds to unceremoniously drag Akari towards the room, beckoning me to follow them.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“We decided long ago that today would be the day you would sire our heirs.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“'Tis time now for you to fulfill that duty, Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"At a loss for words, I look to Himi-no-Mikoto for an explanation.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"Meanwhile, Akari blushes furiously while refusing to meet my gaze, seemingly having already accepted this unexpected turn of events.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi, surely you haven't gotten cold feet now?”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Or is this not enough? Here!”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hyaah!”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wh-What the heck?!”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"At the snap of Himi-no-Mikoto's fingers, Akari's clothes are replaced by a swimsuit.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"My eyes are irresistibly drawn to the alluring curves of\nAkari's scantily-clad body, even as she hastily tries to cover herself up.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"The faint blush shading her otherwise unblemished skin only adds to her charm.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Hmm, maybe this might be more to your liking?”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey, stop messing with me!”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"Akari is practically being turned into a dress-up doll.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, that isn't even the real problem here.”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi...”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"My eyes are helplessly drawn in by Himi-no-Mikoto once more.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"Whenever her amaranthine eyes stare into mine, it's as though a thick fog is being cast over my consciousness.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"All of my worldly concerns evaporate into that sweet haze.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"Before I know it, my every thought is possessed by my desire to possess Akari and Himi-no-Mikoto, and I mutely follow after them like a moth drawn to flame.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Tarry no longer, Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin... please?”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"I allow the two to take me by the hand into their chambers.",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"After a while, I was able to catch my breath.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari, you all right?”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, that was amazing...”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari?”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Zzz, zzz...”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"Having spent the last of her energy, Akari immediately drifts off to sleep.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			{
"For some reason, my consciousness begins to cloud over as well.",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Mgh, is that all?”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Dear me, to think that my power has weakened so much.”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What... do you mean?”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			{
"I somehow manage to put voice to my confusion even as my mind grows hazier and hazier.",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Oh, I had a few remnants of spellforce left, you see.”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Hence I thought to avail myself of it to bring myself some amusement.”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“'Twas nothing more than a mischief of caprice.”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			{
"With a gentle smile, Himi-no-Mikoto strokes Akari's hair as she sleeps peacefully.",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi... Or rather, Soujin, did you enjoy yourself in this world born of melding mine and Akari's memories?”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Heheh, I know I certainly did.”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...So that's why Chihaya and Tooru were here?”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“There you have it. Eheheh, a worthwhile diversion, was it not?”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"As my consciousness dissipates, my memories of having once been Mitsurugi also begin to fade away.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I do apologize for tampering with your memories.”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Would you forgive me if I said I simply wanted to see Mitsurugi again?”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“At worst, you can dismiss it all as having been naught but a dream...”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto...”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ah?!”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“S-Soujin?!”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm... back?”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			{
"Akari eyes me dubiously.",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What are you talking about?”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You won't believe this, Akari. Just now, I...”",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			{
"...was doing what, exactly?",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			{
"Don't tell me I have amnesia again.",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			{
"I check my watch in confusion.",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			{
"Hardly any time's passed since I tried to wake Himi-no-Mikoto.",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			{
"Could I really... have imagined all that?",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry, it's nothing.”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Anyway, how's Himi-no-Mikoto doing?”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			{
"Akari nods and peacefully closes her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			{
"She must be communing with Himi-no-Mikoto's soul.",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah, she's finally awake!”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey, what's the big idea? I was really worried, you know! If you're gonna go into hibernation, at least give me a heads-up next time!”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari, you're talking out loud.”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah─!”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			{
"Akari hastily covers her mouth in embarrassment.",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Haah... ''Twas a most pleasant slumber.' I swear, can you believe her?”",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			{
"She doesn't even know the half of it.",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wait, there's more.”",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“'Did you enjoy yourself, Soujin?' ...What's she talking about now?”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Huh, I have no idea.”",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			{
"We both stare at each other in confusion.",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“At any rate, I'm just relieved that the Founding Empress\nisn't gone forever.”",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, about time I get back to my duties.”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sounds good. I'll go and check in on the Sworn Blades.”",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah, wait just one second...”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			{
"When I turn around at her beckoning, Akari flashes me an uncharacteristically mesmerising smile.",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Akari?"},
			{
"“Heheh, Mitsurugi... We meet again.”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Wha─?!”",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			{
"That voice... could it be...?",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...Tehee.”",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, whaddaya think? Sounded just like her, didn't I?”",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			{
"Akari sticks out her tongue at me impishly.",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Give me a break...”",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ahaha, sorry, sorry!”",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The Founding Empress told me to give it a try, said you'd totally fall for it.”",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Himi-no-Mikoto, don't you be giving Akari any more rotten ideas.”",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Anyway, I'll see you later then.”",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sounds good.”",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			{
"She sends me off with a wave.",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			{
"Yet at the same time, I could swear I saw ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
